// Reusable emergency strip — identical everywhere it appears (00-global.md).
---
<div class="estrip">
  <div class="erow e1">
    <b class="tag">Emergency</b>
    <p>
      Chest pain, stroke signs, severe breathing trouble, major injury,
      thoughts of self-harm: <strong>call 911 or go to the nearest ER.
      Never wait for me.</strong>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="erow e2">
    <b class="tag">Urgent today</b>
    <p>
      Urgent today and I&rsquo;m not reachable: urgent care. Tell me
      after, and I&rsquo;ll fold it into your care.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="erow e3">
    <b class="tag">Everything else</b>
    <p>Message me. Response within 1&ndash;2 business days, usually faster.</p>
  </div>
</div>
